// A distance code is an index into the base and extra-bit tables directly --
// there is no bias, unlike a length code. Thirty codes reach 32768, which is
// the whole of DEFLATE's window.
inf_dist(int n) {
  int ret_i = (import inf_db)[n] + inf_bits((import inf_de)[n]);
} return int ret_i;
